### Bias Detection Questionnaire (20 Questions)

#### Axis 1: Form (BARA/LOMI)
1. When was the last time you changed your mind about something important? (BARA rigidity check)
2. Do you have systems that exist only because you created them? (BARA hoarding check)
3. How many projects have you started but not finished in the last year? (LOMI fragmentation check)
4. Do you feel anxious when your routine is disrupted? (BARA dependency check)
5. Can you sit still for 30 minutes without planning your next action? (LOMI suppression check)

